--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is a modified fork. Files derived from the original carry a notice
recording that they were changed, as required by section 4(b) of the Apache
License, Version 2.0. Files added by this fork are marked as such.

The changes are summarised under "What changed from upstream" in README.md.
In outline: the build was moved to Maven and JavaFX was made an explicit
dependency so the application runs on Java 11 and later, a number of
correctness bugs were fixed, the user interface was rebuilt, and a test suite
was added.

The analysis itself -- alignment, deconvolution of heterozygous indels, and
variant calling -- remains the work of the original authors.

